mso-border-bottom-alt:none;" ><p class=MsoNormal ><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >吉百快递是一家提供网上购物、仓储服务、物流配送、线下实体</font><font face="微软雅黑" >“吉百社区</font></span><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >OTO</font></span><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >门店</font><font face="微软雅黑" >”等一站式服务平台，为商圈、社区、高校等客户群提供便捷购物体验，为中小零售商打造领先的供应链体系、为供应商提供面向全国的销售渠道。</font></span><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >项目职责：本人在项目中主要负责高级开发。采用本地账号登录和第三方账号登录实现了登录模块，</font></span><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >Cookie</font></span><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >和</font></span><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >Redis</font></span><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >实现了购物车模块，</font></span><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >Mysql</font></span><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >实现了订单的存储，与第三方支付平台进行接口对接，调用对方提供的</font></span><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >API</font></span><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >实现了订单的支付功能，使用</font></span><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >SpringBoot</font></span><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >框架和</font></span><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >jsp</font></span><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >实现微信公众号的开发，</font></span><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >jquery Mobile</font></span><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >实现移动端绑定用户页面的展示，用</font></span><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >ActiveMQ</font></span><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><font face="微软雅黑" >给用户微信公众号发送消息的实时提醒。</font></span><span style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr></table><p class=MsoNormal ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;display:none;
